godot/pull/109944#pullrequestreview-3151120206","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109944","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109944#pullrequestreview-3151120206"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109944"}},"submitted_at":"2025-08-25T12:00:06Z","commit_id":"0cace15d72c02340f13555ae12d6d9339bcaeee7"},{"id":3153966656,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc67_bZA","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Approving because the current behavior will infinite loop and is clearly broken. The reason this PR is needed is due to the dangerous nested main loop, which is highly unconventional and not done in any other place in the code:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nwhile (true) {\r\n\t\tDisplayServer::get_singleton()->process_events();\r\n\t\tMain::iteration();\r\n\t\tif (!configure_blender_dialog->is_visible() || confirmed) {\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI agree that it is better to ERR_FAIL and display a warning message for headless. I do wonder if it might be better to avoid invoking `EditorFileSystemImportFormatSupportQueryBlend` in the first place. I do not get why we are creating this whole object only to guaranteed ERR_FAIL.\r\n\r\nShould headless mode perform autodetection? I believe it currently will return true without having set a path, which is inconsistent with the non-headless behavior which disables blend import and returns false.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109944#pullrequestreview-3153966656","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109944","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109944#pullrequestreview-3153966656"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109944"}},"submitted_at":"2025-08-26T05:18:01Z","commit_id":"a001026dbbe35f89c57533d8e6f2c712020df823"}]